Ash's hat (Japanese: サトシのぼうし Satoshi's hat) is an item of clothing that Ash Ketchum is seldom seen without. Throughout Pokémon the Series, Ash has worn seven different hats, one for each of the seven different series.

All of Ash's hats have been produced for people to wear. Ash's Pokémon the Series: Ruby and Sapphire hat was available to purchase at PokémonCenter.com before it shut down. His hats can be found at numerous stores (including the Pokémon Centers in Japan) and on online auction sites such as .

